      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Chancellor Corcelia [npc=38727]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Blademaster Morje [npc=38741]\n- Sentry Loesk [npc=38738]\n- Surmo [npc=38742]\n- a soiled essence [npc=38802]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Resplendent #1: The Light Within [quest=5466]\n- Resplendent #3: At Your Disposal [quest=5468]\n- Secrets of the Stones [quest=5477]\n- Two Sides of the Stone [quest=5478]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:01:27 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is the second in a series of three; a solo task that begins with Chancellor Corcelia in the Resplendent Temple, located at 1700, -15, -22 (inside the front door if coming in from Sarith)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"The Light Within\"\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Chancellor Corcelia'\n_Without pre-requisites:_\nChancellor Corcelia completely ignores your presence.\n_With pre-requisites:_\nChancellor Corcelia gestures to alir spotless surroundings, 'As you can see, we like to keep the temple in pristine shape. It's what Ladrys aleself would want, and what we should all strive to attain. It's an initiate's duty to [help] keep the temple clean and free from... undesirables.'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nChancellor Corcelia says, in Alaran, 'It would do you a world of good to familiarize yourself with the temple, making a note of areas that are off limits to initiates and recruits.' The Nitore's grin grows wider, 'Our temple is a rather large place, and you wouldn't want to end up lost and alone, now would you? There are a few other Nitore [leaders] you should speak with. They may have some tasks for you. In exchange for your help, they should offer some history on our magnificent temple.''\nYou say, 'I'll speak with the leaders'\nChancellor Corcelia smiles warmly as al jots something down, 'Lest you forget, I've noted in your journal the names of those you should speak with.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'An Initiate's Task'.\nChancellor Corcelia has asked you to seek out a few key people within the temple who may have tasks for you to complete in exchange for history surrounding the temple.\n\n---\n\nSeek out Blademaster Morje 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Blademaster Morje spawns in the large circular room (ground level) northeast of the Cancellor (location approximately 1900, -310, -16)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Blademaster Morje'\nBlademaster Morje peers at you suspiciously, 'Another initiate I see. It seems Corcelia's greed has caused her to let just about anyone into the temple now, but never mind that. As long as you're able to kill swinetor, you won't hear me complain. The filthy creatures that burrow beneath this temple are constantly stealing our weapon supplies. None of the Nitore seem to want to get their hands dirty, so I count on initiate's like yoyrself to recover the weapons.'\nRecover stolen temple weapons from swinetor 0/4 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Task Window Says:_ The Swinetor burrowed below the temple have been stealing weapons from their neighbors above.\n_This step updates as you kill Swinetor in the \"In Between\" (the undergrounds caves of the zone -- accessed from a cave entrance on either side of the temple, or by letting yourself fall into the gorge that surrounds the temple)._\n_There is no actual item. This updates upon random kills. Upon an update, you see the emote:_\nYou retrieve a dirty weapon from the dead swinetor.\nSeek out Sentry Loesk 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Sentry Loesk spawns in the top of the western tower. On your map, you'll see a large, circular room northwest of Chancellor Corcelia's location. To access the top level, you need to use the ramp/stairwell that's in the room to the north of that one. Go all the way up the spiral ramp to get to Sentry Loesk's level (1830, 215, 410)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sentry Loesk'\nSentry Loesk bows deeply in your presence. 'Have you come to pray at the [sentry stone]?'\nYou say, 'I'm here to pray at the sentry stone...'\nSentry Loesk takes alir time recalling the history surrounding the powerful relics, 'While many travel here in search of beauty, those that dwell in the temple know its true treasures are the sentry stones. On display in various areas throughout the temple, the stones offer cleansing to those who pray at their base, and wisdom to those who are pure enough to hear their [words].'\nYou say, 'Their words?'\nSentry Loesk smiles at your eagerness, 'Everyone wishes to hear the words of the sentry stones, but only the truly ascended will be spoken to. For now, it's best that you stay near and pray.'\nPray at the sentry stone 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Sit at the sentry stone nearby until you get an update._\nFaint murmurs escape the sentry stone and fill the air with words of decay and beauty.\nYour task 'An Initiate's Task' has been updated.\nSeek out Surmo, the temple attendant 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Task Window Says:_ Find Surmo, the Halfling temple attendant who works in the grand hall.\n_Surmo is on the base level of the temple; just head due north of the zone-in to the circular room furthest north (2500, 25, -21)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Surmo'\nSurmo nearly trips over himself to greet you, 'Hello there, friend! My name's Surmo, originally from Rivervale and now a dutiful servant of the temple, charged with waste [disposal]. I came here on one of the first few airships, and I have to say, I've been having some awfully strange dreams since I arrived!'\nYou say, 'Disposal?'\nSurmo shrugs his shoulders with indifference, 'As you know, the temple's surroundings are occasionally infested with filth, and sometimes that filth sneaks into the temple. It's my job to get rid of it and toss whatever junk is left down these [chutes].'\nYou say, 'What chutes?'\nSurmo scratches his head with obvious confusion, 'I don't really know much about the chutes, except that's where I'm told to put the [waste]. I've also been told not to travel down below the chutes under any circumstances, which is fine by me. I'm a stickler for the rules!' The clumsy halfling puts on a proud smile.\nYou say, 'Waste?'\nSurmo says 'I know, I know! This temple's so pretty, it's hard to imagine any kind of waste within its walls. I blame the pig-people down below. I'm sure they're responsible for the strange swirls of filth I've seen in the eastern sentry tower. They appear faster than I can dispose of them lately, but luckily Corcelia sent you to help me!''\nCollect waste from soiled essences 0/4 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Task Window Says:_ Eradicate soiled essences from the temple and clean up their waste.\n_Soiled essences spawn in the top of the east tower (the opposite side tower from Sentry Loesk -- around 1800, -330, 406) and in the bottom at the dead sump. As with the swinetor, these are kill updates. There are no actual items involved._\n_These mobs don't summon and are snareable/rootable._\nReturn to Chancellor Corcelia 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Chancellor Corcelia'\nChancellor Corcelia welcomes you back with a guarded smile. 'So you've completed your tasks, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I trust that you know your way around the temple quite well by now.'\nThrough a set of initiate tasks, you have met many key people within the Resplendent Temple.\n_Rewards:_\n205 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty\n- Eltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty [item=99799]",
