      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Plann [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Braxi Bone Marrow [item=99817]\n- Goral Bone Marrow [item=100436]\n- Hopper Bone Marrow [item=100358]\n- Selyrah Bone Marrow [item=100001]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a diseased rat - Resplendent Temple [npc=38779]\n- a grove braxi [npc=38773]\n- a grove goral [npc=38771]\n- a grove hopper [npc=38774]\n- a grove selyrah [npc=38766]\n- a mosquito [npc=38744]\n- a rat [npc=38746]\n- an abomination [npc=39743]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:01:34 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Plann in the Resplendent Temple, located at 2120, 430, -340. This is in the underground cave system outside the temple. He's in a dead-end tunnel in the southwest part of the caves._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Plann'\nPlann gazes up at you with a cautious curiosity. With one hoof extended, the young swinetor slowly reaches out to touch your armor before yanking his arm back in fear. 'What're yuh? Why'd something so clean come down ['ere]?'\nYou say, ''Ere?'\nPlann says 'This's the in-between, home to swinetor like me an' other creatures nobody wanted.' Clearly impressed by your presence, the budding necromancer takes a slow step closer, 'Wanta see a [trick]?''\nYou say, 'What trick?'\nPlann throws his small snout into the air and snorts, 'I know whole bunches of tricks, just you wait. Yuh'll be so impressed with Plann! But can't do tricks without supplies. Yuh wanta [help] Plann out? Clean stranger won't be sorry!'\nYou say, 'I'll help you out'\nPlann kicks his hooves in the mud with excitement, 'Yuh bring supplies, and Plann will do tricks!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Plannty of Tricks'.\nPlann has a few tricks up his sleeve and would love to show them to you! All he needs are a few items...\n\n---\n\nRetrieve wings from mosquitoes 0/2 (Resplendent Temple)\nRetrieve whiskers from rats 0/2 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Rats and mosquitoes are found in the cave system. The task updates randomly after kills; no item is involved._\nReturn to Plann 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Plann'\nPlann lets out a snort so loud it shakes the surrounding walls, 'Clean stranger looks lots better now!'\nYou are turned into a mosquito for a few moments.\nSpeak with Plann 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Plann'\nPlann speaks quickly, fearing your departure, 'Don't leave! Plann can do more! One [special] trick just for the clean stranger, Plann never done before.'\nYou say, 'Special?'\nPlann grins devilishly from ear to ear, 'Yuh bring just one bone marrow, Plann do the trick for everybody! So simple!'\nGive any type of bone marrow to Plann 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Bone marrow drops from animal type creatures above ground, outside the temple. You can use any type to update this step (pre-lootable; be ready for a fight upon turn-in, as \"an abomination\" spawns and attacks you)._\nDefeat Plann's creation 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nSpeak with Plann 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Plann'\nPlann looks from side to side with worry, hoping you didn't notice his trick go horribly wrong. 'Special trick is a success! Clean stranger still alive!' The young swinetor returns to practicing his tricks with a smile.\n_Rewards:_\n341 platinum\nEltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty\n- Eltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty [item=99799]",
