      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Hoarder Paoliq [npc=38730]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Piq`a Crafted Torch [item=99844]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a blazing Ulork [npc=39744]\n- a grazing braxi [npc=38765]\n- a grove braxi [npc=38773]\n- an Ulork diviner [npc=38753]\n- an Ulork noble [npc=38755]\n- an Ulork occultist [npc=38754]\n- an Ulork vicar [npc=38756]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:01:37 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Hoarder Paoliq in the Resplendent Temple, located at 2200, -15, -330. This is in the underground network of caves (about three open caverns deep if travelling through them from the east entrance at 2705, -400, -38)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Hoarder Paoliq'\nHoarder Paoliq sticks his snout close to your armor and sniffs, 'Yuh don't smell like an [Ulork].' The filthy swinetor steps back to get a full view, 'Yuh don't look like one of them neither.' Convinced you are not a member of his rival clan, Hoarder Paoliq relaxes a bit.\nYou say, 'Of course I'm not an Ulork; are you blind?!'\nHoarder Paoliq spits on the ground upon hearing his rival clan's name, 'Those sad excuses for swinetors are the sworn enemy of Clan Piq`a, an' I got a [plan] to kill every last one of 'em.'\nYou say, 'What plan?'\nHoarder Paoliq grins, baring a mouthful of rotten teeth, 'Don't wanta tell yuh all my secrets just yet, but those Ulork swine will get what's comin' to 'em. Are yuh [in], or should I just kill yuh too?'\nYou say, 'I'm in!'\nHoarder Paoliq says 'So much to do before the big plan explodes! I'll give yuh an easy task, yuh'll like it. Nothin' like diggin' in an Ulork's ear, or pickin' the hairs from a grove braxi!''\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death to Clan Ulork!'.\nHoarder Paoliq has a plan to destroy Clan Ulork, but he needs your help to ensure its success!\nGather clumps of ear wax from dead Ulorks.\nCollect coarse hair from braxi that roam the grove.\nPick a fire flower, which usually grows on the walls that lead down to the in-between.\n\n---\n\nKill Ulorks for their ear wax 0/5 (Resplendent Temple)\n_This step will update randomly as you kill \"Ulork\" mobs. A fair amount of them can be found in the northern branch of the west tunnels (2600, 370, -330)._\n_Success message upon mob death:_ An Ulork Vicar has earfuls of sticky, yellow wax.\n_Failure message upon mob death:_ An Ulork Vicar has clean ears.\nKill braxi for their coarse hair 0/5 (Resplendent Temple)\n_This step will update randomly as you kill \"braxi\" mobs above ground outside the temple._\n_Success message upon mob death:_ a grove braxi is covered in coarse hair. You cut a lock for Hoarder Paoliq.\n_Failure message upon mob death:_ a grazing braxi has no suitable coarse hair.\nCollect a fire flower 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Fire Flowers are found growing along the walls of the in-between (the large gorge surrounding the Temple). Using third-person view, you'll be able to see them growing along the wall (one such location is next to the entrance bridge)._\n_Use Levitate and pluck the flower from the wall on your way down. This isn't an actual item; only an update._\nSpeak with Hoarder Paoliq 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hoarder Paoliq'\nHoarder Paoliq takes the items from you and immediately gets to work crafting a rather large torch. 'Here's the secret weapon! Take it into the throne room and light it up. Yuh should be able to burn the whole place down!'\n_You receive a Piq`a Crafted Torch._\nBurn down the Ulork throne room 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_The Ulork Throne Room can be found in the northern branch of the west tunnels. In the center of the large room is a row of protruding bones (around 2830, 375, -330). Pre-clear, and then stand between the teeth near the back by the 'throne' and click the torch. This spawns a mob._\nDefeat a blazing Ulork 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_This mob is slowable and hits for a max ~10,500._\nSpeak with Hoarder Paoliq 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hoarder Paoliq'\nHoarder Paoliq lets out a raunchy snort, 'I can still hear the squeals of those useless Ulork!'\nYou have helped Hoarder Paoliq burn down his rival clan's throne room.\n_Rewards:_\n410 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty\n**Submitted by:** Taseis of Luclin/Stromm\n- Eltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty [item=99799]",
    },
