      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Udgar the Brave [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Resplendent Temple: Piq`a Throne Room [zone=864]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Piq`a brawler [npc=40589]\n- a Piq`a deadraiser [npc=38749]\n- a Piq`a defender [npc=40595]\n- a Piq`a diabolist [npc=38751]\n- a Piq`a fighter [npc=40588]\n- a Piq`a guard [npc=40592]\n- a Piq`a noble [npc=38752]\n- a Piq`a priest [npc=40590]\n- a Piq`a royal [npc=40593]\n- a Piq`a seer [npc=40594]\n- a Piq`a soothsayer [npc=38750]\n- a Piq`a warlock [npc=40591]\n- a blob of filth [npc=38758]\n- a rotting corpse [npc=38747]\n- an animated corpse [npc=38726]\n- an undead lieutenant [npc=40586]\n- an undead soldier [npc=40587]\n- an undead trooper [npc=40585]\n- an undead warrior [npc=40584]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:01:41 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Udgar the Brave in the Resplendent Temple, located at 2900, 130, -325. This is in the underground network of caves -- in a dead end in the north-central part of the caves._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Udgar the Brave'\nUdgar the Brave stares you boldly in the eye, 'I demand to know who sent yuh! It was those swinetor imposter [Piq`as], wasn't it?'\nYou say, 'The Piq`as?'\nUdgar the Brave squints his eye at you skeptically, 'Yuh come down here an' yuh have no idea about the war that rages on between Clan Ulork and the lesser Clan Piq'a?' The burly swinetor pauses to think before snorting with excitement, 'This must mean yuh don't have a [side] yet!'\nYou say, 'A side?'\nUdgar the Brave shouts 'Clan Ulork claims \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ as its own!'\nUdgar the Brave looks you up and down, 'Yuh're not much to look at, nothing but skin an' bones, but I bet yuh could lead an army. Yuh'll need weapons first, and the best place to get 'em is to steal 'em from Piq`as!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Death to Clan Piq`a!'.\nUdgar the Brave thinks you'd make a great army leader! If you bring him the proper supplies, he'll raise you an undead army to help defeat the Piq`a Clan.\n\n---\n\nKill Piq`a clan members and steal their weapons 0/4 (Resplendent Temple)\nRemove bones from blobs of filth 0/2 (Resplendent Temple)\n_This will update randomly as you kill the blobs of filth (located in the caves to the east of the in-between's main room)._\nSpeak with Udgar the Brave 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Udgar the Brave'\nUdgar the Brave takes the requested items from you with a grin, 'These bones will build a good army, but I need an essence from the undead to animate each soldier.'\nCapture essences from weakened corpses 0/4 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Task Window Says:_ Udgar needs essences from corpses in order to raise your undead army.\n_This step updates randomly as you kill rotted and animated corpses in the in-between._\nSpeak with Udgar the Brave 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Udgar the Brave'\nUdgar the Brave takes the essences, and immediately begins to cast a spell, 'I have raised yuh an army of undead! They're already surrounding the Piq`a throne room, just waitin' for yuhr command. I can cast my magic to sneak yuh inside when yuh're [ready].'\nPiq'a Throne Room is now available to you.\n_You are assigned an expedition called \"Piq'a Throne Room\" (capped at six players)._\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nUdgar the Brave says 'I'll send you into the throne room now, where an undead army awaits your command.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Resplendent Temple.\nInvade the Piq`a throne room with your undead army 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\n_Task Window Says:_ Udgar will teleport you to the throne room when you are ready, so that you may kill every last Piq`a within!\n_Zone into an instanced version of Resplendent Temple. You'll see four undead skeletons in front of you which are at your command. Direct them to attack the Piq`a mobs in the area (to get them to attack the fighter, say \"fighter\"). The mob types are:_\n\\- a Piq`a brawler\n\\- a Piq`a defender\n\\- a Piq`a fighter\n\\- a Piq`a guard\n\\- a Piq`a priest\n\\- a Piq`a royal\n\\- a Piq`a seer\n\\- a Piq`a warlock\nYou say, 'Hail, an undead lieutenant'\nan undead lieutenant says 'We await your orders, commander. Which target would you like me to attack? [Retreat] is not an option.'\nYou say, 'Attack the warlock!'\nan undead lieutenant says 'Preparing for battle, commander!'\n_Once all Piq`a mobs are dead, you can zone out by speaking with one of the skeletons._\nReturn to Udgar the brave 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Udgar the Brave'\nAt your command, Udgar's undead army destroyed all the Piq`as within the throne room.\nUdgar the Brave revels in your victory, 'Sholoth smiles on Clan Ulork today!'\n_Rewards:_\n410 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty\n- Eltarki's Diary - Priceless Beauty [item=99799]",
