      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Perfectionist Naerys [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 73\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a mosquito [npc=38744]\n- a rotting corpse [npc=38747]\n- an Ulork diviner [npc=38753]\n- an Ulork occultist [npc=38754]\n- an animated corpse [npc=38726]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:06:10 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Perfectionist Naerys in the Resplendent Temple, located at 2400, 35, -245. This is in the underground network of caves outside the temple. To get to Naerys, climb up the steep hill in the large, central cavern. He's in one of the doorways to the room._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Perfectionist Naerys'\nPerfectionist Naerys says, in Alaran, 'My goodness,' alir gurgles, clearly appalled, 'I would never have thought that something that looked like you could possibly be [sentient]!'\nYou say, 'Sentient?'\nPerfectionist Naerys says, in Alaran, 'Hmm, well, I suppose if you would help us I can overlook your misshapen appearance for the time being; I need [help] getting out of this foul place!'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nPerfectionist Naerys says, in Alaran, 'Kill the denizens of this atrocious pit of filth, that I may find a means of digression.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Taking Out the Trash'.\nPerfectionist Naerys has asked you to wipe out the abominations that dweel in the in-between.\n\n---\n\nKill 3 Ulork occultists or diviners 0/3 (Resplendent Temple)\nKill 3 walking corpses 0/3 (Resplendent Temple)\nKill 3 mosquitoes 0/3 (Resplendent Temple)\nSpeak with Perfectionist Naerys 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Perfectionist Naerys'\nPerfectionist Naerys thanks you graciously. 'As reward for your deed, I shall allow you to live - despite the fact you're clearly an abomination. You may spend the remainder of your days in this den of putrescence, however, you must never set foot in our sacred temple again or I will be forced to slay you.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n68 platinum",
