      walkthrough = "**Status: Unsolved**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Resplendent Temple [zone=811]\n**Who:**\n- Vaericus the Vainglorious [npc=38733]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Nitore idealist [npc=38784]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 24 00:06:25 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Vaericus the Vainglorious in the Resplendent Temple, located at 500, 35, 5 (just north of the zone-in from Sarith)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Vaericus the Vainglorious'\nVaericus the Vainglorious says, in Alaran, 'Greetings to you as well, my friend,' alis eyes narrow, calculatingly, 'What is your business in this place? Have you come to [see the temple]?'\nYou say, 'I've come to see the temple'\nVaericus the Vainglorious says, in Alaran, 'Ahh, I can see you like myself, appreciate a thing of true beauty. A pity, is it not, that the inhabitants of such a magnificent temple, should be so [decrepit] of heart themselves?'\nYou say, 'Decrepit?'\nVaericus the Vainglorious says, in Alaran, 'Indeed, they are, my friend. They would most likely kill you as soon as look at you. It saddens me to think they defile this temple daily with their very presence.' It gives you a sideways glance, stroking its tentacles thoughtfully, 'If only there was some way to [eliminate] them..'\nYou say, 'I'll eliminate some of them'\nVaericus the Vainglorious says, in Alaran, 'Why, that is truly a brilliant idea, my friend!' alis eyes glow with malice, but alis voice stays friendly and jovial, 'If you were to slay them, we could expunge them, and return the sanctity of this once glorious temple.'\n_As task window pops up with three tasks to choose from._\nYou have been assigned the task 'An End To Perfection'.\nVaericus has asked you to rid the temple of its inhabitants.\n\n---\n\nKill 7 idealists (Resplendent Temple)\nSpeak with Vaericus 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Vaericus the Vainglorious'\nVaericus thanks you warmly for your help. It seems more delighted at the deaths of the Nitore than any real concern for the temple.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n136 platinum",
